[
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:0.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:0.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:0.3"], "en": "The Legends of the Elders (Therāpadāna) Pilindavaccha Chapter 10 The Legend of the Elder Ajita (Ajitatthera-apadāna)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:1.1"], "en": "“The Victor named Padumuttara,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:1.2"], "en": "who has gone beyond all phenomena,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:1.3"], "en": "having plunged into the Himalayas,”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:1.4"], "en": "The Leader of the World sat down.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:2.1"], "en": "I did not see the Perfectly Awakened One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:2.2"], "en": "nor did I hear his voice.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:2.3"], "en": "Seeking food for my mother,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:2.4"], "en": "I was wandering in the forest.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:3.1"], "en": "There I saw the Perfectly Enlightened One.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:3.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:3.3"], "en": "Seeing those thirty-two excellent marks, I was filled with wonder:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:3.4"], "en": "\"What kind of being could this be?\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:4.1"], "en": "Having observed the bodily marks,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:4.2"], "en": "I recalled my own knowledge;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:4.3"], "en": "for this was heard by me from the elders:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:4.4"], "en": "This well-spoken word of the wise:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:5.1"], "en": "\"According to those words,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:5.2"], "en": "this one will become a Buddha.\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:5.3"], "en": "\"What if I were to honor him?", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:5.4"], "en": "It will purify my destiny.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:6.1"], "en": "Having quickly returned to the hermitage...\"", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:6.2"], "en": "Taking honey and oil,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:6.3"], "en": "and taking a water-pot,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:6.4"], "en": "I approached the Leader.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:7.1"], "en": "Having taken up the three staffs,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:7.2"], "en": "I placed them in the open air;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:7.3"], "en": "having lit a lamp, I set it there.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:7.4"], "en": "I paid homage eight times.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:8.1"], "en": "For seven days and nights, the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:8.2"], "en": "the Supreme among Men, remained seated.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:8.3"], "en": "Then, at the end of the night,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:8.4"], "en": "the Leader of the World arose,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:9.1"], "en": "his mind serene and his heart joyful.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:9.2"], "en": "Throughout every day and night,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:9.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:9.4"], "en": "with a mind full of faith, I offered a lamp to the Buddha with my own hands.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:10.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:10.2"], "en": "All the forests on Mount Gandhamādana consist of fragrant trees,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:10.3"], "en": "through the supernatural power of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:10.4"], "en": "They came into the presence of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:11.1"], "en": "Whatever flowers and fragrances there were,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:11.2"], "en": "and whatever blossoms grew from the earth;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:11.3"], "en": "Through the power of the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:11.4"], "en": "all gathered together at that time,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:12.1"], "en": "as far as the Himavat mountains.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:12.2"], "en": "Both the nāgas and the garuḍas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:12.3"], "en": "desiring to hear the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:12.4"], "en": "came into the presence of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:13.1"], "en": "The ascetic named Devala,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:13.2"], "en": "the foremost disciple of the Buddha,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:13.3"], "en": "together with one hundred thousand seers, [dwelt there].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:13.4"], "en": "He approached the presence of the Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:14.1"], "en": "Padumuttara, the Knower of the World,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:14.2"], "en": "the recipient of offerings;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:14.3"], "en": "Sitting in the community of bhikkhus,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:14.4"], "en": "he spoke these verses:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:15.1"], "en": "“He who lit the lamp for me— ”", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:15.2"], "en": "With serene and wholesome hands,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:15.3"], "en": "I shall praise him;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:15.4"], "en": "listen as I speak.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:16.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:16.2"], "en": "For sixty thousand eons he will delight in the world of the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:16.3"], "en": "and a thousand times he will be a king.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:16.4"], "en": "He will become a wheel-turning monarch.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:17.1"], "en": "The sixteenth recitation section.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:18.1"], "en": "Thirty-six times he will be the lord of the gods.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:18.2"], "en": "He will exercise sovereignty over the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:18.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:18.4"], "en": "he will rule a vast kingdom on earth for seven hundred years.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:19.1"], "en": "By this gift of an island,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:19.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:19.3"], "en": "one gains a vast regional sovereignty, beyond counting and incalculable.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:19.4"], "en": "He will possess the divine eye;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:20.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:20.2"], "en": "he will always see for eight fathoms in every direction.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:20.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:20.4"], "en": "For a person passing away from the deva-worlds or being reborn there,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:21.1"], "en": "whether by day or by night.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:21.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:21.3"], "en": "He will hold up a lamp for the being who is being born,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:21.4"], "en": "endowed with meritorious deeds.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:22.1"], "en": "As far as the city extends,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:22.2"], "en": "so far will it shine;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:22.3"], "en": "whatever womb he is reborn into, [there he shall illuminate].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:22.4"], "en": "Both divine and human [splendor].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:23.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:23.2"], "en": "Indeed, by the fruit of the eight lamps from that gift of lamps to the horse, [he attained this].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:23.3"], "en": "This person shall not be born hereafter;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:23.4"], "en": "this is the fruit of the gift of a lamp.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:24.1"], "en": "After a hundred thousand aeons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:24.2"], "en": "Born of the Okkāka clan,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:24.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:24.4"], "en": "he will be a teacher in the world known by the family name Gotama.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:25.1"], "en": "He is an heir to the Dhamma,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:25.2"], "en": "a true-born son fashioned by the Dhamma;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:25.3"], "en": "having fully understood all taints, he is free from them.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:25.4"], "en": "He will attain Nibbāna, free from taints,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:26.1"], "en": "having satisfied the Fully Awakened One,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:26.2"], "en": "Gotama, the bull among the Sakyans.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:26.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:26.4"], "en": "‘He shall be a disciple of the Teacher known by the name Ajita.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:27.1"], "en": "For sixty thousand eons,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:27.2"], "en": "I delighted in the world of the gods;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:27.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:27.4"], "en": "there too, a hundred lamps shone for me at all times.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:28.1"], "en": "In the world of the gods or among humans,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:28.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:28.3"], "en": "my radiance streams forth as I remember the Supreme Buddha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:28.4"], "en": "I produced even greater joy.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:29.1"], "en": "Having descended from the Tusita heaven,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:29.2"], "en": "I entered my mother’s womb.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:29.3"], "en": "For me, while still a householder,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:29.4"], "en": "a vast light arose;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:30.1"], "en": "having gone forth from the home, I departed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:30.2"], "en": "I went forth into homelessness;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:30.3"], "en": "approaching Bāvarī,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:30.4"], "en": "I entered into discipleship.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:31.1"], "en": "While dwelling in the Himalayas,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:31.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:31.3"], "en": "I heard of the Leader of the World as he was seeking the supreme goal.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:31.4"], "en": "I approached the Leader:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:32.1"], "en": "the Tamed One, the Buddha, the Tamer of men,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:32.2"], "en": "who has crossed the flood and is free from acquisitions.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:32.3"], "en": "The Buddha taught Nibbāna,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:32.4"], "en": "the liberation from all suffering;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:33.1"], "en": "my arrival there has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:33.2"], "en": "I have satisfied the Great Sage;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:33.3"], "en": "the three knowledges have been attained,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:33.4"], "en": "and the Buddha’s teaching has been accomplished.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:34.1"], "en": "In a hundred thousand aeons ago,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:34.2"], "en": "when I gave that lamp,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:34.3"], "en": "I have not known a state of woe.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:34.4"], "en": "This is the fruit of the gift of a lamp:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:35.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:35.2"], "en": "my defilements have been incinerated... [and so forth].", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:35.3"], "en": "I dwell free from taints.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:36.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:36.2"], "en": "Welcome indeed has come to me... [as before] ...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:36.3"], "en": "Thus was the Buddha’s teaching spoken:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:37.1", "PA_tha-ap_402:37.2"], "en": "the four analytical knowledges, and so forth...", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:37.3"], "en": "“Thus was the teaching of the Buddha spoken.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:38.1"], "en": "In this way, indeed, the Venerable Elder Ajita spoke these verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:39.1"], "en": "The legend of the Elder Ajita is the tenth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:39.2"], "en": "The Fortieth Chapter: Pilindavaccha.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:40.1"], "en": "Its summary verse:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:41.1"], "en": "Pilindavaccha and Sela,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:41.2"], "en": "Sabbakittī, Madhundada,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:41.3", "PA_tha-ap_402:41.4"], "en": "Kūṭāgārī, Bākula, and the one called Giri Saḷalasa.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:42.1"], "en": "Including the Sabbadosajita,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:42.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:42.3"], "en": "the verses counted here are five hundred.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:42.4"], "en": "\"And twenty more than that.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:43.1"], "en": "Now, the summary of the sections (vagga-uddāna) is:", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:44.1"], "en": "\"Paduma and Ārakkhada,\" and so forth.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:44.2"], "en": "And Umā with scented water;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:44.3"], "en": "with a single lotus, mindful of the sound,", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:44.4"], "en": "he worshipped the Bodhi tree with Mandārava flowers.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:45.1"], "en": "The Avaṭa and the Pilinda;", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:45.2", "PA_tha-ap_402:45.3"], "en": "the verses counted here are seventy-four verses.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:45.4"], "en": "And eleven hundred.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:46.1"], "en": "The *Padumavagga-daśaka*.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"},
{"segs": ["PA_tha-ap_402:47.1"], "en": "The fourth century is completed.", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T13:11:20Z"}
]
